        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://constantinemi.com/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village sits at the confluence of the Fawn River and the St. Joseph River, a spot that once powered sawmills, flour mills, and a brewery.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        9,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
